{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/247d3a455739d4d272d81776f0c042a2.avif?t=1762628555\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras_big/247d3a455739d4d272d81776f0c042a2.avif?t=1762628555 width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Fight</u></strong> through the deepest zones of the ocean to gather rare resources, rescue infected animals, and uncover the mysteries at the heart of your magical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/24f4de1abc6dcfdde1e5044025767822.poster.avif?t=1762628555\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/24f4de1abc6dcfdde1e5044025767822.webm?t=1762628555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/24f4de1abc6dcfdde1e5044025767822.mp4?t=1762628555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Customize</strong></u> everything from your home to your character's appearance, with a wide range of expressive aesthetic options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/1c19144837a8e68c731df59450da7029.poster.avif?t=1762628555\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/1c19144837a8e68c731df59450da7029.webm?t=1762628555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https